          "id": "dialogue-0001",
          "reply": "Ah, that's a thing of worry. Dreams can be restless. Have ye tried a tea of valerian root before bed? It helps many with rest. ---\n{\"action\": \"nods\", \"mood\": \"thoughtful\", \"internal_thought\": \"Hope the valerian brings sweet dreams\", \"language_hints\": []}",
