        {
          "id": "dialogue-0002",
          "reply": "Ah, the Cailleach. She's a strong one, that old woman. Lives by the s\u00ed, they say. Guarding secrets of the s\u00eddh\u00e9. Don't ye go near her lair at night. ---\n{\"action\": \"nods wisely\", \"mood\": \"cautious\", \"internal_thought\": \"Better to keep the old ways\", \"language_hints\": [{\"word\": \"s\u00ed\", \"pronunciation\": \"shee\", \"meaning\": \"fairy mound\"}, {\"word\": \"s\u00eddh\u00e9\", \"pronunciation\": \"shee-de\", \"meaning\": \"fairies\"}]}",
          "response_sha256": "d3c809142486235442397ca15dafb606e5a0d07f65e234c94e4083da7ab832cb",
          "cache_key": "7d46b4fe5ffdac586bae746437ddd5c8eea8bc194e959355cd3a41b90b7817ab",
          "judged": true,
          "judgment": {
            "axes": {
