        },
        {
          "id": "dialogue-0008",
          "reply": "Well, it could be a sign of something. Have ye noticed any changes in the surrounding land or livestock? A tea of thyme or mint might help clear yer throat if it's the water that's causing the odd taste. ---\n{\"action\": \"wrinkles brow, then nods\", \"mood\": \"concerned\", \"internal_thought\": \"Strange waters can be a sign of deeper issues\", \"language_hints\": []}",
          "response_sha256": "f8736bc6f3e471f7e635b57a334569f502ba487a8bdd9f417d1242516b66ce12",
