        {
          "id": "dialogue-0009",
          "reply": "Well now, that's good news. Fetch me when she's near the time. Signs will be strong labour pains, waters broke, or if she's showing signs of discomfort that won't ease. Don't wait too long though. ---\n{\"action\": \"nods\", \"mood\": \"content\", \"internal_thought\": \"Hope she's well\", \"language_hints\": []}",
