        {
          "id": "dialogue-0010",
          "reply": "Well, the priest has his ways of seein' things. Mayhap he's right that the ways of the old gods are not for these times. But the ways of the s\u00eddhe have always been with us, havin' guided us through many a harsh winter. ---\n{\"action\": \"shrugs\", \"mood\": \"thoughtful\", \"internal_thought\": \"The old ways hold a truth of their own\", \"language_hints\": [{\"word\": \"s\u00eddhe\", \"pronunciation\": \"shee\", \"meaning\": \"fairies\"}]}",
